1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,539
Each cycle has three steps.

2
00:00:02,539 --> 00:00:06,601
Heat to ninety five degrees: the strands separate.

3
00:00:06,601 --> 00:00:09,739
Cool to about fifty five: the primers stick.

4
00:00:09,739 --> 00:00:14,322
Warm to seventy two: Taq builds new strands from the primers.

5
00:00:14,322 --> 00:00:17,643
And every cycle doubles the number of copies.

